msgstr "カラーミーショップに接続"

#: includes/Adapters/ColorMe/ColorMeAdapter.php:195
msgid "Not connected yet."
msgstr "まだ接続していません。"

#: includes/Adapters/ColorMe/ColorMeAdapter.php:208
